{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-explainer-about-iron-man-explain-the-character-tony-stark-and-iron-man-the-comic-creati/audio/main-760e3c85db47.mp3","durationSec":211.104,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.58,"text":"Iron Man is a superhero from Marvel Comics."},{"start":3.3,"end":5,"text":"Under the metal, he is a normal man."},{"start":5.7,"end":9.32,"text":"His name is Tony Stark, and his full name is Anthony Edward Stark."},{"start":10.1,"end":12.66,"text":"Tony is very rich, and he is also a genius."},{"start":13.4,"end":15.24,"text":"He is an inventor and an engineer."},{"start":16.02,"end":19.18,"text":"That means he designs machines and builds them with his own hands."},{"start":19.96,"end":21.06,"text":"Tony does not have magic."},{"start":21.46,"end":22.62,"text":"He does not come from space."},{"start":23.48,"end":25.5,"text":"His power is his powered armor suit."},{"start":26.22,"end":28.68,"text":"This suit is a strong metal body that he wears."},{"start":29.12,"end":31.5,"text":"It lets him fly, and it protects him."},{"start":32.34,"end":34.96,"text":"In the comics, the armor is red and gold."},{"start":36,"end":44.62,"text":"So when we talk about Iron Man, we really talk about two things at the same time: the smart man inside, and the suit he made."},{"start":45.54,"end":48.3,"text":"Iron Man was made by a small team at Marvel Comics."},{"start":49.48,"end":52.62,"text":"Stan Lee was the editor, and he had the first idea for the character."},{"start":53.44,"end":55.78,"text":"Larry Lieber wrote the words of the first story."},{"start":56.34,"end":59.18,"text":"Don Heck drew the story and designed how Tony Stark looked."},{"start":59.92,"end":62.16,"text":"Jack Kirby designed the cover and the first armor."},{"start":62.86,"end":65.94,"text":"So four people worked together, and each one added one piece."},{"start":65.94,"end":70.28,"text":"Iron Man first appeared in a comic book called Tales of Suspense."},{"start":70.8,"end":73.74,"text":"This was a Marvel series with many short stories in one book."},{"start":74.56,"end":76.22,"text":"Iron Man was in issue number 39."},{"start":76.76,"end":78.64,"text":"The cover date was March 1963."},{"start":79.88,"end":84.3,"text":"After that, Iron Man returned in more Tales of Suspense stories and later series."},{"start":85.04,"end":86.56,"text":"Now let us look at the story itself."},{"start":86.95,"end":91.16,"text":"A good way to follow it is this: problem, invention, result."},{"start":92.18,"end":92.84,"text":"First, the problem."},{"start":92.84,"end":95.42,"text":"Tony Stark is a rich weapon maker."},{"start":96.14,"end":99.5,"text":"He goes to a war zone, and he is hurt and taken captive."},{"start":100.02,"end":102.54,"text":"He is a prisoner, and he is badly injured."},{"start":103.52,"end":104.76,"text":"Next, the invention."},{"start":105.66,"end":107.9,"text":"Tony is still an engineer, even in a prison."},{"start":108.54,"end":110.68,"text":"He works in secret with the parts around him."},{"start":111,"end":114.92,"text":"He builds a heavy metal suit to keep his body alive and to fight his way out."},{"start":115.44,"end":116.56,"text":"Then, the result."},{"start":117.22,"end":120.34,"text":"He escapes in the armor, and he goes home a changed man."},{"start":120.98,"end":122.16,"text":"He becomes Iron Man."},{"start":122.98,"end":125.94,"text":"This is why armor and technology are the heart of the character."},{"start":126.82,"end":128.18,"text":"Tony does not find his power."},{"start":128.66,"end":131.38,"text":"He builds it, step by step, with his mind."},{"start":132.16,"end":134.48,"text":"Many years later, the story moved to the cinema."},{"start":135.18,"end":138.86,"text":"The film Iron Man came out in the United States on May 2, 2008."},{"start":138.86,"end":140.9,"text":"Jon Favreau was the director."},{"start":141.78,"end":142.4,"text":"Robert Downey Jr."},{"start":142.48,"end":144.08,"text":"played Tony Stark and Iron Man."},{"start":144.71,"end":150.72,"text":"The film was made by Marvel Studios, and it was their first film in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, or MCU."},{"start":151.44,"end":156.06,"text":"The film follows the same problem, invention, result idea from the comics."},{"start":156.98,"end":160.4,"text":"Tony is captured, he builds a suit, and he becomes a hero."},{"start":161.3,"end":164.44,"text":"To show the suit on screen, the team used two ways together."},{"start":164.88,"end":167.52,"text":"Actors wore real armor costumes for some scenes."},{"start":167.88,"end":171.62,"text":"For other scenes, the suit was made with computer effects, called CGI."},{"start":172.34,"end":175.78,"text":"A company named Industrial Light and Magic did much of this work."},{"start":176.54,"end":180.6,"text":"Real parts and computer parts were mixed, so the armor looked heavy and real."},{"start":180.6,"end":183.78,"text":"Iron Man is not only a hero alone."},{"start":184.44,"end":187,"text":"In the comics, he was one of the founding members of the Avengers."},{"start":187.76,"end":190.38,"text":"The Avengers are a team of Marvel heroes who fight together."},{"start":190.98,"end":194.88,"text":"So from early on, Iron Man fought both alone and with that team."},{"start":196.04,"end":198.36,"text":"The 2008 film had a similar job on screen."},{"start":198.76,"end":204.4,"text":"It was the first MCU film, and it helped start the shared Marvel Cinematic Universe and the Avengers film era."},{"start":204.9,"end":210.52,"text":"The smart inventor, the red and gold armor, and the first MCU film kept Iron Man in view for years."}],"words":[{"text":"Iron","start":0,"end":0.3},{"text":"Man","start":0.3,"end":0.6},{"text":"is","start":0.6,"end":0.8},{"text":"a","start":0.8,"end":0.96},{"text":"superhero","start":0.96,"end":1.46},{"text":"from","start":1.46,"end":1.82},{"text":"Marvel","start":1.82,"end":2.08},{"text":"Comics","start":2.08,"end":2.58},{"text":"Under","start":3.3,"